      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"I was in my Lovesac all day.\"\n\nSee? The marketing writes itself. \ud83d\ude02\u26bd\n\n#WorldCup #lovesac @Lovesac\n\nVideo",
