      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "What if Donald Trump was the commentator for the World Cup? \ud83d\ude02\u26bd\n\nIt could've been a goal. It wasn't a goal. It almost was. Many people are saying it.\n\n#worldcup #brazil #morocco\n\nVideo",
