      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Brazil has given the world many gifts.\nPronouncing \"p\u00e3o de queijo\" is apparently not one of them. \ud83d\ude02\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7\n\n#worldcup\n\nVideo",
